#
# Counter-example for math:WeightTensorShape: a weight tensor naming the layer it
# parameterizes but omitting the math:ParameterSpace it lives in (sh:minCount 1).
# Validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent and NO other finding
# (math:UnframedWeightTensor). Bound by ex:ecWeightTensorNoParameterSpace.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:unframedWeight a math:WeightTensor ;
    math:weightOf ex:layer .

ex:layer a math:NeuralLayer .
